    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Michael Gilmartin are delighted to bring this exceptionally well-presented, four bedroom B rated home to the market.\n\nSituated in the popular Drummin Village residential development on the outskirts of Nenagh town, this property offers convenient access to Nenagh town centre and the M7 motorway.\n\nThe interior has been finished to a high standard, featuring attractive tiling throughout the hallway, kitchen/dining area and bathrooms. The modern fitted kitchen comprises contemporary grey units, walnut worktops and integrated hob and oven.\n\nTo the rear of the property is a spacious living room featuring a solid fuel stove and a door leading to a large pergola with a tiled floor. The rear garden enjoys a desirable south-facing aspect, providing an excellent outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining.\n\nOn the first floor, there are three bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from an ensuite, along with a fully tiled family bathroom.\n\nThe second floor provides an exceptionally spacious double bedroom, complete with its own ensuite, offering excellent flexibility for family living, guests or working from home.\n\nThis impressive property would make an ideal first-time buyer home, family residence or investment opportunity. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.425w x 1.669d\nFully tiled\n\nKitchen/Dining - 2.977w x 4.422d\nModern fitted kitchen\n\nWC understairs - 0.772w x 1.494d\n\n\nSitting Room - 4.924w x 4.651\nInset solid fuel stove, patio door to rear garden and pergola\n\nBedroom 1 - 1.873w x 3.309d\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.307w x 2.818d\nCarpet Flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.780w x 1.617d\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.828w x 3.916d\nEnsuite, carpet flooring\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.958w x 1.079d\nTiled, Electric Shower\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.825w x 4.650d\nEnsuite\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.974w x 1.172d\n\n\n"
      },
      {
